<center>
<div class="card border-primary-emphasis fade" style="max-width:25rem;background-color:#A9BDBD;color:#392806">
<div class="card-header">Getting Started</div>
<div class="card-body">

The quickest way to get going is to play with @SunStarSys/orion's default build of <https://iconoclasts.blog> and hollow out the markdown sources in `trunk/content`.  ~90% of the styling customizations are in [`trunk/content/css/local.css`](https://github.com/SunStarSys/www.iconoclasts.blog/blob/trunk/content/css/local.css) &mdash; adjust to taste!

The other 10% involves choosing an appropriate bootstrap 5 CSS theme to replace the corresponding files in `content/css/bootstrap.*`; we recommend <https://bootswatch.com> for ideas.

The final step is to rejigger the topmatter navigation menus in `templates/main.html.*`.  Our AI translator will keep everything in sync on demand.

Need help customizing the `Perl` build system in `lib/` and other Django templates in `templates/` to fit your use case?  We are at your service!

</div>
</div>
</center>


</div>
